{
  "info": {
    "name": "GBVR-IoT OpenAPI",
    "description": "GBVR-IoT 平台开放 API 接口集合，支持录像管理、设备控制、直播、PTZ 等功能",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://your-domain.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "sk_live_your_api_key_here",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "录像管理",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "获取录像文件列表",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/open-api/recordings?device_id=&channel_id=&start_time=&end_time=",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "open-api", "recordings"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "device_id",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "设备ID（可选）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "channel_id",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "通道ID（可选）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "source_type",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "录像来源类型（可选）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "plan_id",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "录像计划ID（可选）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "stream_id",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "流ID（可选）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "media_server_id",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "媒体服务器ID（可选）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "start_time",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "开始时间（可选）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "end_time",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "结束时间（可选）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "start",
                  "value": "0",
                  "description": "分页起始位置"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "每页数量"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "获取录像文件列表，支持多条件筛选和分页"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "获取录像文件详情",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/open-api/recordings/:id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "open-api", "recordings", ":id"],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "录像文件ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "根据ID获取录像文件详细信息"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "开始录像",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"device_id\": \"34020000001320000001\",\n  \"channel_id\": \"34020000001320000001\",\n  \"type\": 1,\n  \"customized_path\": \"\",\n  \"max_second\": 0\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/open-api/recordings/start-record",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "open-api", "recordings", "start-record"]
            },
            "description": "手动开始指定通道的录像\n\n**前提条件：**\n1. 通道必须开启自动直播(auto_live=1)\n2. 通道不能绑定到启用的录像计划\n3. 通道必须配置 stream_id 和媒体服务器\n\n**参数说明：**\n- device_id: 设备ID\n- channel_id: 通道ID\n- type: 录像类型(0=HLS, 1=MP4，默认1)\n- customized_path: 自定义录像保存路径(可选)\n- max_second: MP4切片时间(秒)，0=使用配置(可选)\n\n**错误提示：**\n- 通道未开启自动直播\n- 通道已绑定到启用的录像计划\n- 通道未配置 stream_id\n- 通道未配置媒体服务器"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "停止录像",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"device_id\": \"34020000001320000001\",\n  \"channel_id\": \"34020000001320000001\",\n  \"type\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/open-api/recordings/stop-record",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "open-api", "recordings", "stop-record"]
            },
            "description": "手动停止指定通道的录像\n\n**参数说明：**\n- device_id: 设备ID\n- channel_id: 通道ID\n- type: 录像类型(0=HLS, 1=MP4，默认1)"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
